WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:01.800
Someone

00:01.880 --> 00:03.280
Bring me my sword

00:04.480 --> 00:05.880
Yes

00:10.880 --> 00:11.720
This reform

00:11.880 --> 00:13.280
Since it has begun

00:13.400 --> 00:15.733
Must be carried through to the end

00:21.760 --> 00:23.760
Have someone deliver this sword to Xie Xuan

00:23.840 --> 00:25.840
Whoever dares obstruct the new policies

00:27.200 --> 00:28.160
I authorize him

00:28.240 --> 00:29.800
To execute first and report later

00:36.500 --> 00:58.000
The aristocratic clans across multiple regions formed a united grand army, vowing to execute Xie Xuan to purge the court of treachery.
